umb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%BD%E6%AA%90%E5%B8%BD\" title=\"宽檐帽\"><img alt=\"宽檐帽\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-310601.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-310601.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"92\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-310601.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"125\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%BD%E6%AA%90%E5%B8%BD\" title=\"宽檐帽\">宽檐帽</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>S02</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>装置式未来</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：310604</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">无论是人类还是神秘学家，都有修饰的本能。万年前，人们就把兽牙、砾石、贝壳穿起来挂在颈间，即使是那些被称为必需品的物件，人们也会挑剔它们的颜色与款式。看看起初被时尚界评价为“总是会毁容”的眼镜吧，现在花样翻新，有些人还会专门选一副平光眼镜做装饰。基于此，当然不难理解“思想”控制器诞生之初就拥有十余种颜色——金色的还是高级公民专供哩！<br />如果不满足于颜色的变化，请您务必尝试“思想”控制器的新造型——兼具实用与美观的宽檐帽！版型利落、质感上乘、颜色可更换，挺括的帽檐让您在人群中脱颖而出，保证您走在时尚的前沿——更重要的是，完全免费。同志，驾驭知识，也驾驭时尚吧！</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"310604\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310604.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/36/Belonging-310604.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“思想”的力量<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">THOUGHT Device</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>在帽檐侧面配备的标准“思想”控制器，可供经过聚合的公民接入“人类-神经网络”，从而利用神经脉冲控制机器人与各个系统。<br />为生活必需品提供更多可选择的外观，是人文主义精神的完美实现。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310605.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c5/Belonging-310605.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">模块化帽架<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Smart Hat Stand</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />6<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>使用3826号设施常见的模块化腿部零件，搭配圆润可爱的橄榄球形机身，拥有精确的自动巡航、自主避障、智能跟随功能。<br />谁不想要一顶会自己向你走来的帽子呢？再也不用担心找不到或者出门忘记戴上“思想”控制器了！</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310606.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c6/Belonging-310606.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">全息投影幕布<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Hologram Curtain</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />3<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>极具构成主义风尚的艺术装饰幕布，由四块全息投影悬浮模块组成。<br />可任意组合出无数种图案、形状与幕布大小，满足您的个性化定制需要！</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%E9%A9%BE%E9%A9%B6%E8%80%851.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 思维驾驶者1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%E9%A9%BE%E9%A9%B6%E8%80%851.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%E9%A9%BE%E9%A9%B6%E8%80%851.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%E9%A9%BE%E9%A9%B6%E8%80%851.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%E9%A9%BE%E9%A9%B6%E8%80%851.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%E9%A9%BE%E9%A9%B6%E8%80%851.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%